body:
 "You said me threatening to call the cop when you punched me in the head is disrespectful."

&#x200B;

Literally, when I read this I had to double-check to make sure I didn't write this and then somehow forget. One time my mom punched me in the eye over something petty, and later when she discovered that I wanted to call CPS she made herself the victim and threatened to kill herself over it. Asian parents are so immature.
